msgstr "Standard-E-Mail-App"

#: ui/dialogs/settings-dialog.slint:2103
msgid "Email links in browsers and other apps open in Flectar Mail."
msgstr "E-Mail-Links in Browsern und anderen Apps öffnen sich in Flectar Mail."

#: ui/dialogs/settings-dialog.slint:2104
msgid ""
"To open email links from browsers and other apps here, choose Flectar Mail "
